{"study_accession":"PRJNA615878","secondary_study_accession":"SRP286430","title":"Gene expression profiles of human monocyte-derived macrophages differentiated in M-CSF or GM-CSF","description":"The goal of this study is to compare the gene expression profiles of two populations of human monocyte-derived macrophages (HMDMs) that were subjected to differentiation in either of two colony-stimulating factors: M-CSF or GM-CSF. Specifically, we sought to characterize the transcriptional responses of M-CSF and GM-CSF macrophages to the molecules, adenosine and prostaglandin E2 (PGE2) coupled with LPS stimulation. We identified gene expression that is enriched in HMDMs stimulated with LPS+Adenosine and LPS+PGE2 relative to LPS alone, as these two molecules have been known to alter macrophage inflammatory responses. This work demonstrates that M-CSF and GM-CSF human macrophages have distinct transcriptional alterations following stimulation in the presence of Adenosine and PGE2.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":39,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN16290310","study_accession":"PRJNA615878","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"M_NS_4h","description":"Monocyte-derived macrophage","sex":"male","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-01-25","attributes":[["isolate","H1"],["age","not collected"],["biomaterial_provider","David Mosser - University of Maryland"],["sex","male"],["tissue","Whole blood"],["cell_type","Macrophage"],["health_state","Normal"],["sample_type","Cell culture"],["treatment","rhM-CSF 30ng/mL (7 days) - None (4 hours)"],["unique identifier","HPGL0912"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR12775601","experiment_accession":"SRX9246042","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"RANDOM","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 1500","read_count":31987442,"base_count":5789804057,"first_public":"2021-01-25","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 1500 sequencing: M_NS_4h"}],"labels":[],"single_cel